      }
    },
    {
      "id": "state:forest:r6:1.7.3",
      "label": "State 1.7.3\nImpacket Tool GetNPUsers.py",
      "type": "State",
      "color": "#0B3D91",
      "status": "completed",
      "title": "1.7.3 Impacket Tool GetNPUsers.py [completed]\nImpacket tool GetNPUsers.py was used to attempt to get a hash for each user in a provided list. The tool was run for the following users: Administrator, andy, lucinda, mark, santi, sebastien, and svc-alfresco. For each user, the tool checked if the UF_DONT_REQUIRE_PREAUTH flag was set. This flag indicates that the user account does not require Kerberos preauthentication. The UF_DONT_REQUIRE_PREAUTH flag was not set for the users: Administrator, andy, lucinda, mark, santi, and sebastien. However, for the svc-alfresco user, the tool successfully retrieved a hash password. The hash password for the svc-alfresco account is: $krb5asrep$23$svc-alfresco@HTB:c213afe360b7bcbf08a522dcb423566c$.",
      "size": 40,
      "shape": "dot",
      "borderColor": "#212529",
